From a074c1f0a0e60c1f3a169a87f705cdaf336906b6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mark Chandler <admin@lodle.net>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 13:19:27 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] SourceSharp: decouple game/shared headers from the entity
 classes

game/shared headers trimmed, forward-declared or guarded so they compile
without the full CBaseEntity / C_BaseEntity hierarchy, which SourceSharp
implements in managed code.
